1300a2cbce7766ac8609aed58ef62edd8e/ss_b5414a1300a2cbce7766ac8609aed58ef62edd8e.600x338.jpg?t=1748776233"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760770/d66f9bab19e23a7e3c4b514a34a94b2ac5763183/ss_d66f9bab19e23a7e3c4b514a34a94b2ac5763183.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748776233","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760770/d66f9bab19e23a7e3c4b514a34a94b2ac5763183/ss_d66f9bab19e23a7e3c4b514a34a94b2ac5763183.600x338.jpg?t=1748776233"}],"short_description":"Not far in a galaxy... A diner with questionable hygiene, bubbling with dark secrets and darker humor, in the middle of cosmic nothingness. Welcome to Space Savory. Don\u2019t be fooled by appearances, the best flavor in the universe is cooked right here. (Only within the observable part.)","steam_appid":3760770,"support_info":{"email":"studiodelusionart@gmail.com","url":"https://www.delusionartstudio.com/communication"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.delusionartstudio.com/"}